    "turns": [
        {
            "role": "N",
            "text": "If we take SSD apart, which idea truly changed the direction of research?",
            "sourceIds": [],
            "claimIds": [],
            "contentOrigin": "editorial-hook"
        },
        {
            "role": "N",
            "text": "Two-stage detectors were accurate but depended on a separate proposal phase. SSD pursued real-time detection by predicting object classes and box offsets directly from a single network pass.",
            "sourceIds": ["source-2016-ssd-primary", "source-benchcouncil-ai100-catalog"],
            "claimIds": ["claim-2016-ssd-membership", "claim-2016-ssd-description"],
            "contentOrigin": "commentarySections.historical-background"
        },
        {
            "role": "A",
            "text": "That sounds like a promising direction. What mechanism actually makes it work?",
            "sourceIds": [],
            "claimIds": [],
            "contentOrigin": "editorial"
        },
        {
            "role": "B",
            "text": "Several feature maps at different resolutions predict scores and offsets for default boxes of multiple shapes. High-resolution maps capture small objects, while deeper maps cover larger receptive fields.",
            "sourceIds": ["source-2016-ssd-primary"],
            "claimIds": ["claim-2016-ssd-membership", "claim-2016-ssd-description"],
            "contentOrigin": "commentarySections.core-idea"
        },
        {
            "role": "N",
            "text": "Experts generally see SSD as an influential single-stage detector that made multiscale default-box prediction practical. Its speed-accuracy tradeoff shaped later real-time detection systems.",
            "sourceIds": ["source-2016-ssd-primary", "source-2016-ssd-secondary"],
            "claimIds": ["claim-2016-ssd-membership", "claim-2016-ssd-description"],
            "contentOrigin": "commentarySections.long-term-legacy"
        },
        {
            "role": "N",
            "text": "Seen alongside YOLO, SSD reveals how the same technical question can echo across different eras.",
            "sourceIds": [
                "source-2016-ssd-primary",
                "source-2016-ssd-secondary",
                "source-benchcouncil-ai100-catalog",
                "source-2016-ssd-portrait"
            ],
            "claimIds": ["claim-2016-ssd-membership", "claim-2016-ssd-description"],
            "contentOrigin": "editorial-closing"
        }
    ]
